# a Gemstone Mine with three mining counters (a land, not a creature), and Bot2 a Kin-Tree Nurturer that endured 1 with a +1/+1
# counter (a creature, but not Bot1's). On turn 3 the Bloodflies attack: the ability does not trigger, so Bot2 takes only the
# flyer's 1 combat damage (19); its Nurturer has no flying or reach.

